      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1405,
      "text": "If they reject you, then say, “My deeds are mine and your deeds are yours[38]. You are not responsible for what I do, nor am I responsible for what you do.”",
      "surah": {
